      "content": "The diffusion coefficient of an ideal gas is proportional to its mean free path and mean speed. The absolute\ntemperature of an ideal gas is increased 4 times and its pressure is increased 2 times. As a result, the\ndiffusion coefficient of this gas increases x times. The value of x is ___________:",
      "options": [],
